Photorealistic vintage 1980s Japanese Hi-Fi audio asset: one single round transport push button, viewed perfectly straight-on, centered, filling about 70 percent of the image, isolated on a pure flat black background. Outer ring: precision-lathed champagne silver aluminum with radial brushed grain. Just inside it, a thin continuous ring of glowing fluorescent teal VFD light, with a tiny red indicator dot at the top edge. Face: completely blank dark grey smoked glass, slightly domed, with one soft circular reflection. Tokyo audiophile hardware mood, product photography, crisp focus, perfectly circular and symmetrical. Absolutely no symbols, no icons, no arrows, no text, no letters. One object only, no watermark.
